 allows users to explore point groups, symmetry operations, and molecular structures interactively. Featuring real-time 3D visualization, ARCHIMED - MolSym provides a modern and intuitive tool, ideally suited for learning about symmetry in chemistry.\n", "short_description": "ARChimEd - MolSym (Augmented Reality for Chimie and Education \u2013 Molecular Symmetry) is a mixed-reality educational application designed for the Meta Quest platform. It allows users to explore symmetry operations and point groups through interactive and gamified modules."}]}, "developer_name": "VRAI Learning", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrailearning.com/en/mentions-legales-politique-confidentialite", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Univ Artois", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vrailearning.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24885337847771132"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1130619989254350"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1130619989254350"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1760076000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1130619989254350"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24875520638752853", "version": "0.3.8"}, "id": "710261985306